==English==

===Etymology===
Said to be from the Irish name [[Seamus|Séamus]], on account of many American police officers being of Irish descent.

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|shä'məs}}, {{IPA|en|/ˈʃɑːməs/}}
* {{enPR|shā'məs}}, {{IPA|en|/ˈʃeɪməs/}}
* {{rhymes|en|eɪməs|s=2}}
* Homophones: [[Seamus|Séamus]] (''of'' -ā-/-eɪ-/{{monospace|-eI-}} ''pronunciation'')

